This repository is an unofficial, community deployment template for Agenta
(https://github.com/agenta-ai/agenta). It contains no Agenta source code: it
packages thin Docker wrappers, Railway service configuration and documentation
that deploy the official, unmodified Agenta container images.

Agenta itself is licensed by Agentatech UG: content outside its "ee/"
directories is MIT-licensed, and content under "ee/" carries a separate
enterprise license. The Agenta container images used here are the OSS images.

